# Visual Changes Patch Summary

## Files Modified

### 1. scripts/preview/src/assets/themes/var-ui-common.css
**Root cause fix**: Added `--swt-font-family` composite variable.
The original CSS defined `--swt-font-family-zh`, `--swt-font-family-en`, `--swt-font-family-other`
individually, but the HTML body's `font-family` declaration referenced `var(--swt-font-family)`
which was **undefined**, causing Arial fallback → serif rendering on Chinese systems.

Add after `--swt-font-family-other:Roboto`:
```
--swt-font-family:Roboto,SourceHanSansCN-Regular,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif
```

### 2. scripts/preview/index.gts.html
Changed body font-family fallback from `Arial` to `Roboto`:
```
- font-family: var(--swt-font-family, Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif);
+ font-family: var(--swt-font-family, Roboto, 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif);
```

